WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.160
Episode 32

01:38.180 --> 01:40.200
Your Majesty, everyone is here.

01:40.220 --> 01:42.000
We can start the meal.

01:52.220 --> 01:54.050
This is a family meal.

01:54.180 --> 01:57.600
Help yourselves!

02:01.180 --> 02:02.490
Your Majesty,

02:02.730 --> 02:03.990
since it's a family meal,

02:04.010 --> 02:05.330
my presence is improper.

02:05.330 --> 02:07.560
You're thick-skinned. It's alright!

02:08.450 --> 02:09.810
Go ahead with it!

02:15.060 --> 02:16.470
I don't feel myself today

02:16.490 --> 02:19.710
and can't eat anything.

02:19.730 --> 02:21.990
So, I don't eat

02:22.010 --> 02:23.800
and I'll watch you eating.

02:23.820 --> 02:25.760
We haven't had any gathering for a long time.

02:26.060 --> 02:28.330
I've got a lot of memorials to handle.

02:28.980 --> 02:31.370
So liquor won't be served. There you go!

02:33.930 --> 02:35.730
Help yourselves!

02:36.980 --> 02:38.980
This is not on imperial court.

02:38.980 --> 02:40.730
Don't stand on ceremony.

02:47.260 --> 02:49.450
He was rigid ever since he was young.

02:49.490 --> 02:52.480
Now he is still a piece of wood.

02:54.090 --> 02:55.760
Look at him!

02:57.540 --> 02:59.430
Never showed much table manners from childhood.

02:59.450 --> 03:02.730
He is still like this.

03:07.570 --> 03:08.840
Fan Xian!

03:09.450 --> 03:10.840
Yes, Your Majesty!

03:11.060 --> 03:15.370
Who do you think is more promising of them two?

03:19.900 --> 03:22.530
This is a family meal. You can speak at will!

03:22.900 --> 03:23.630
No conviction?

03:23.650 --> 03:24.760
No!

03:24.780 --> 03:26.690
Then I'm gonna say it.

03:30.290 --> 03:33.760
Your Majesty, are you playing a joke with me?

03:35.180 --> 03:35.850
This question will put me

03:35.850 --> 03:37.140
in a deep trap.

03:37.140 --> 03:37.780
No matter how I answer it,

03:37.780 --> 03:38.830
it's leading me to death.

03:38.850 --> 03:40.560
Loyal ministers don't fear death.

03:40.900 --> 03:41.980
If all loyal ministers die,

03:41.980 --> 03:43.970
there would be only sinister ministers left.

03:44.450 --> 03:45.900
Are you the loyal type

03:45.900 --> 03:47.120
or the sinister type?

03:47.140 --> 03:48.760
It's up to Your Majesty.

03:48.850 --> 03:50.400
I'm OK either way.

03:53.210 --> 03:54.760
How do you two

03:54.780 --> 03:56.560
think of him?

03:58.700 --> 04:01.760
Spectacularly talented and important to the kingdom.

04:04.980 --> 04:07.450
Loyal ministers and sinister ministers are common.

04:07.620 --> 04:11.090
But crafty loyal ministers are rare.

04:12.260 --> 04:14.250
Important

04:14.620 --> 04:16.020
and rare!

04:16.020 --> 04:18.310
They are really high comments to him.

04:18.330 --> 04:19.720
He deserves

04:19.740 --> 04:21.850
however high comments.

04:22.740 --> 04:23.800
If so,

04:23.820 --> 04:24.820
he should be protected

04:24.820 --> 04:26.600
in future.

04:26.700 --> 04:29.440
No matter whichever one of you take over the throne,

04:29.580 --> 04:32.970
he should be an important minister on court.

04:38.490 --> 04:40.000
Your Majesty is still young and strong.

04:40.020 --> 04:41.810
You'll live a long life.

04:45.580 --> 04:47.000
I agree.

04:47.020 --> 04:49.010
Live a long life?

04:51.260 --> 04:55.850
If I live a long life,

04:56.140 --> 04:59.240
will you be happy

04:59.260 --> 05:01.040
or unhappy?

05:08.770 --> 05:10.520
Come on! Take a seat!

05:10.540 --> 05:12.130
Go on with it!

05:13.090 --> 05:14.600
Hurry!

05:22.820 --> 05:24.440
Do you like it?

05:24.460 --> 05:25.760
Your Majesty,

05:26.090 --> 05:26.960
I don't know.

05:26.980 --> 05:28.290
You don't know?

05:28.650 --> 05:31.480
I was too nervous to feel the taste of it.

05:31.740 --> 05:33.130
All the officials from the six divisions

05:33.420 --> 05:36.030
reported the other day that

05:36.050 --> 05:38.130
you leaked highly confidential information

05:38.300 --> 05:39.630
which is related

05:39.650 --> 05:41.810
to Yan Bingyun's being trapped in Beiqi.

05:42.210 --> 05:43.920
Do you know it?

05:46.460 --> 05:48.000
I've heard of it.

05:48.020 --> 05:49.410
Me too.

05:49.650 --> 05:51.980
You have a lot of followers

05:51.980 --> 05:53.470
with a wide network of adherents.

05:53.490 --> 05:54.980
It's bad enough

05:54.980 --> 05:56.210
if it's spread out there

05:56.210 --> 05:57.920
for just a few days.

05:58.260 --> 05:59.840
I have no adherents,

05:59.860 --> 06:02.090
but I'll still eradicate the misunderstandings

06:02.490 --> 06:03.840
from an impartial standpoint.

06:03.860 --> 06:04.580
I do have some friends

06:04.580 --> 06:06.030
on the court.

06:06.050 --> 06:07.470
I'll warn the ones who need to be warned

06:07.490 --> 06:09.070
and persuade the ones who need to be.

06:09.090 --> 06:13.160
I'll stop the rumor from confusing the masses.

06:17.210 --> 06:18.020
Fan Xian,

06:18.020 --> 06:21.280
you need to prove yourself innocent

06:21.300 --> 06:24.290
and resolve this.

06:28.420 --> 06:30.070
How do Your Majesty want me to handle it?

06:30.090 --> 06:33.470
Escort Xiao En to Beiqi

06:33.490 --> 06:35.400
and get Yan Bingyun back.

06:35.420 --> 06:37.400
We are in short of a leader.

06:37.420 --> 06:38.840
Your Majesty want me

06:38.860 --> 06:40.280
to go to Beiqi for the exchange?

06:40.300 --> 06:42.050
Only your personal participation

06:42.050 --> 06:45.440
can erase the misgivings on court.

06:45.860 --> 06:47.090
Is that an imperial edict?

06:47.090 --> 06:48.410
It's a suggestion

06:50.540 --> 06:52.370
which depends on you.

06:58.050 --> 06:59.520
Remember what I said.

06:59.540 --> 07:01.050
No matter what you're requested,

07:01.050 --> 07:03.040
don't promise

07:03.300 --> 07:05.290
unless you're clearly requested to with an imperial edict.

07:05.420 --> 07:08.440
Fan Xian, you had been to the Lin's Residence

07:08.610 --> 07:10.640
before coming to the palace?

07:12.260 --> 07:13.350
Yes, I did.

07:13.370 --> 07:14.820
Prime Minister has a lot of practical experience.

07:14.820 --> 07:16.580
You should listen to him.

07:16.580 --> 07:19.410
If I don't want to go to Beiqi,

07:19.540 --> 07:20.680
does that constitute disobedience to the imperial edict?

07:20.700 --> 07:22.090
No!

07:22.610 --> 07:24.570
But your engagement has to be changed.

07:25.820 --> 07:28.040
What do you mean?

07:28.300 --> 07:32.350
There are a lot of misgivings from the six divisions on you.

07:32.370 --> 07:34.680
If you marry Lin Wan'er

07:34.700 --> 07:36.370
and take over the Neiku,

07:36.580 --> 07:39.640
that doesn't make much sense.

07:40.890 --> 07:42.720
It's not too bad for you.

07:42.740 --> 07:44.250
If that's the case,

07:44.300 --> 07:46.800
you can fix another marriage contract

07:46.820 --> 07:50.480
as there are a lot of good ladies in the capital city.

07:54.540 --> 07:56.960
I'd like to go to Beiqi.

07:56.980 --> 07:58.560
Think about it. Think about it.

07:58.580 --> 08:00.600
I'm not forcing you.

08:00.820 --> 08:02.440
You must think about it carefully.

08:02.460 --> 08:04.770
I really want to go. I can't wait.

08:04.770 --> 08:06.090
Alright!

08:06.170 --> 08:09.600
Ask Chen Pingping for the schedule.

08:10.650 --> 08:12.750
I'll hold the wedding for you

08:12.770 --> 08:15.880
after you come back from Beiqi.

08:16.170 --> 08:18.090
Thank you, Your Majesty!

08:19.770 --> 08:23.480
I'm a bit tired and need a rest.

08:23.770 --> 08:26.010
Finish it by yourselves.

08:51.290 --> 08:52.570
I'm fine!

09:03.220 --> 09:04.600
I'm fine!

09:10.700 --> 09:12.250
By the way, Fan Xian,

09:13.490 --> 09:15.400
I prepared a gift for you.

09:27.920 --> 09:30.630
=Xinyang=

10:05.610 --> 10:07.130
Rise!

10:12.490 --> 10:14.080
Are you waiting for me?

10:14.170 --> 10:17.330
I want to say goodbye here to Your Highness.

10:17.460 --> 10:18.920
You lost the title as Director

10:19.340 --> 10:21.330
and got banished to defend the remote boarders

10:21.580 --> 10:23.650
because of me.

10:24.050 --> 10:25.450
It's hurting me

10:26.900 --> 10:28.770
inside my heart.

10:39.490 --> 10:40.560
Fan Xian was assigned by His Majesty to go north.

10:40.580 --> 10:41.640
The journey starts immediately.

10:41.660 --> 10:42.960
Got that!

10:48.410 --> 10:51.120
Your Highness, a message from the court

10:51.140 --> 10:54.210
says Fan Xian will lead a mission to go north.

10:56.660 --> 10:57.800
Very good!

10:57.820 --> 11:00.830
The boarder is remote and deserted.

11:00.850 --> 11:04.240
It's inevitable to have accidents.

11:04.260 --> 11:06.040
My place of stationing

11:06.140 --> 11:07.260
is also on the way to the north.

11:07.260 --> 11:09.440
As soon as I get Fan Xian's schedule,

11:09.460 --> 11:11.440
I'll have that delivered to you very fast.

11:11.460 --> 11:14.160
I'll wait for that.

11:38.580 --> 11:40.130
What are you looking at?

11:40.410 --> 11:41.490
Eh!

11:41.780 --> 11:43.800
Look at these flowers.

11:43.820 --> 11:46.260
There is abundant water and sunshine.

11:46.260 --> 11:48.370
Why are they all withered?

11:50.050 --> 11:52.000
The horrifying Head Chen

11:52.020 --> 11:54.280
is now worried about the flowers by the side of the wall.

11:56.820 --> 12:00.160
They were planted by your mom years back.

12:02.220 --> 12:03.270
If you're worried,

12:03.290 --> 12:05.440
we can have it trimmed by a gardener

12:05.460 --> 12:07.040
or moved into a flowerpot.

12:08.140 --> 12:09.650
Your mom said

12:10.530 --> 12:12.480
it has its own destiny.

12:13.290 --> 12:15.010
Let it grow as it likes.

12:15.700 --> 12:17.770
So it's always left unattended?

12:18.660 --> 12:20.650
Yeah!

12:21.050 --> 12:23.010
No matter how far I go these years,

12:23.140 --> 12:25.690
I had been thinking about them.

12:26.220 --> 12:27.480
Yeah!

12:28.820 --> 12:30.930
No matter how far I go recently,

12:30.930 --> 12:33.270
I had been thinking about them.

12:33.290 --> 12:36.040
I was afraid of losing them after I came back.

12:39.370 --> 12:41.160
They may not be able to

12:41.820 --> 12:44.250
go through this winter.

12:45.170 --> 12:46.690
You miss her?

13:03.900 --> 13:05.580
It's alright! These flowers can still be saved.

13:05.580 --> 13:06.880
They are in lack of potassium.

13:06.900 --> 13:08.330
Potassium?

13:09.930 --> 13:11.460
I've grown some medical herbs

13:11.460 --> 13:12.590
while I was learning poison from the teacher.

13:12.610 --> 13:13.760
I will make some medicine powder

13:13.780 --> 13:15.370
and save these flowers with it.

13:17.220 --> 13:20.450
Don't worry. I am its destiny.

13:29.410 --> 13:32.720
Your mom planted them and you save them.

13:37.930 --> 13:39.810
That's also destiny.

13:44.930 --> 13:46.240
The journey this time

13:46.260 --> 13:48.810
is both a test and an opportunity.

13:48.900 --> 13:50.270
But bear in mind

13:50.290 --> 13:52.030
to get Yan Bingyun back

13:52.050 --> 13:54.450
in a safe way.

13:54.610 --> 13:55.370
Got it.

13:55.370 --> 13:56.560
One more point.

13:56.580 --> 13:58.160
Stay vigilant to one person.

13:58.490 --> 14:00.800
Shen Zhong, Commander-in-chief of Embroidered Uniform Guards.

14:00.820 --> 14:02.480
You must be careful with him.

14:02.530 --> 14:04.370
He is a very dangerous person.

14:04.900 --> 14:06.120
It mustn't be someone good

14:06.140 --> 14:07.720
who can be remembered by you.

14:08.410 --> 14:09.560
All the rest documents

14:09.580 --> 14:11.240
have been put on your carriage.

14:11.260 --> 14:12.950
Read them on the way.

14:12.970 --> 14:15.710
You must memorize the political situation of Beiqi.

14:15.730 --> 14:16.960
Sure!

14:20.580 --> 14:21.880
You're leaving for Beiqi

14:21.900 --> 14:23.760
in a few days.

14:23.780 --> 14:25.460
I'll send people to protect you secretly

14:25.460 --> 14:28.480
in case Princess Royal does something bad to you.

14:28.900 --> 14:30.030
Sure!

14:30.050 --> 14:31.710
Have you met Lin Ruofu?

14:31.730 --> 14:32.590
Yes!

14:32.610 --> 14:33.920
What did he say?

14:35.610 --> 14:36.970
He asked me

14:36.970 --> 14:38.150
not to promise anything

14:38.170 --> 14:39.440
required by His Majesty.

14:39.460 --> 14:41.480
But you promised it all.

14:42.580 --> 14:43.440
His Majesty said

14:43.460 --> 14:45.150
if I don't go to Beiqi,

14:45.170 --> 14:47.080
my marriage will be changed.

14:49.140 --> 14:50.660
Even though the task of visiting Beiqi

14:50.660 --> 14:51.910
is important this time,

14:51.930 --> 14:52.710
it is not as important

14:52.730 --> 14:55.130
as your life.

14:57.970 --> 14:59.270
I think you're a good person.

14:59.290 --> 15:00.480
Me?

15:01.290 --> 15:02.720
A good person?

15:04.530 --> 15:06.270
It's your first time

15:06.290 --> 15:08.270
to say something like this over the years.

15:08.290 --> 15:10.840
I have a good sense of judgement which can save a lot of trouble.

15:13.580 --> 15:16.340
After you come back from the north,

15:16.340 --> 15:17.530
you can gradually take over

15:17.530 --> 15:18.370
the Investigator's Office.

15:18.370 --> 15:21.050
By then, the Neiku and the Investigator's Office

15:21.050 --> 15:23.210
will be all in your hands.

15:24.580 --> 15:26.720
I'll assist you secretly

15:26.930 --> 15:29.350
to turn you into the No.1 minister of Nanqing.

15:29.370 --> 15:31.840
No one will be able to jeopardize

15:32.170 --> 15:34.440
your safety by then.

15:34.460 --> 15:35.510
Not even His Majesty?

15:35.530 --> 15:36.510
You shouldn't ask like that.

15:36.530 --> 15:37.920
I'll keep my mouth shut!

15:40.730 --> 15:41.710
Let's go!

15:41.730 --> 15:44.040
Someone is waiting for you in the Bagua Hall.

15:44.220 --> 15:45.520
Waiting for me?

15:45.610 --> 15:47.250
You'll see after you arrive.

15:49.100 --> 15:50.440
I think

15:50.460 --> 15:53.050
poison A4 is the best.

15:53.050 --> 15:54.170
I think B3

15:54.170 --> 15:55.100
is the most difficult to detoxicate.

15:55.100 --> 15:55.240
What if

15:55.240 --> 15:56.240
=Senior Fellow Apprentice Leng, Acting Director=
What if

15:56.240 --> 15:56.370
What if

15:56.370 --> 15:57.320
you poison yourself?

15:57.340 --> 15:58.570
Well...

15:59.340 --> 16:02.470
Junior Fellow Apprentice, do you still remember me?

16:02.490 --> 16:03.760
Senior Fellow Apprentice Leng?

16:03.780 --> 16:04.680
Yeah! Yeah!

16:04.700 --> 16:07.200
Mr. Fei is away.
I'm in temporary charge of the Third Division.

16:07.220 --> 16:09.000
I heard you're going to Beiqi?

16:09.020 --> 16:09.970
The Third Division

16:09.970 --> 16:11.020
prepared something for you.

16:11.020 --> 16:12.150
Come and check it out.

16:12.170 --> 16:13.200
Nice to meet you, Senior Fellow Apprentices!

16:13.220 --> 16:14.350
Nice to meet you, Junior Fellow Apprentice!

16:14.370 --> 16:15.560
Let's catch up later.

16:15.580 --> 16:16.840
Come over here.

16:27.460 --> 16:29.150
You are in pretty good shape.

16:29.170 --> 16:30.720
This is the right size.

16:31.460 --> 16:33.570
Come on. Have a try!

16:33.900 --> 16:35.210
What is it?

16:39.140 --> 16:40.450
See!

16:40.660 --> 16:42.880
It is fire-proof when worn inside.

16:42.900 --> 16:45.250
But it can't resist constant burning.

16:46.610 --> 16:47.460
It can also defend you from

16:47.460 --> 16:50.480
the harm of some sharp weapons.

16:50.530 --> 16:51.220
If your enemy

16:51.220 --> 16:52.470
uses machete axe,

16:52.490 --> 16:54.890
you'd better evade from that.

16:56.050 --> 16:58.290
This is a newly-developed crossbow.

16:58.290 --> 17:00.330
Pad here and it'll shoot the arrows.

17:03.700 --> 17:04.720
Wrong direction.

17:04.740 --> 17:06.110
It's very hidden

17:06.130 --> 17:07.360
but not so destructive.

17:07.380 --> 17:09.480
It is deadly only if shot to lethal parts.

17:10.170 --> 17:11.320
Never mind!

17:11.340 --> 17:13.270
A4 poison is easy to be detoxicated.

17:13.290 --> 17:13.930
He will come back to life

17:13.930 --> 17:15.560
after a while.

17:16.500 --> 17:17.870
Umbrella cover made of asbestos cloth.

17:17.890 --> 17:19.770
Very strong umbrella structure.

17:19.980 --> 17:22.390
Open it when falling down from high.

17:22.410 --> 17:24.250
It'll help reduce the speed of falling.

17:24.890 --> 17:25.860
This rope can sustain

17:25.860 --> 17:27.380
the weight of four to five people

17:27.380 --> 17:28.720
without a problem.

17:28.740 --> 17:31.230
You can strangle a few people

17:31.250 --> 17:33.480
with it when you feel bored.

17:33.980 --> 17:35.390
This looks just like a jade pendant.

17:35.410 --> 17:38.010
You can smash it in times of emergency

17:39.130 --> 17:41.320
and hide yourself.

17:41.340 --> 17:43.030
I have put some piquant powder as well

17:43.050 --> 17:44.440
which can stop the enemies.

17:44.740 --> 17:46.720
Open the door quickly!

17:48.820 --> 17:50.320
No!

17:53.410 --> 17:54.770
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

17:54.980 --> 17:56.320
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!

17:59.130 --> 18:00.870
Don't swing it. There are needles in it.

18:00.890 --> 18:01.560
Look!

18:01.580 --> 18:03.230
It's C6 poison on them

18:03.250 --> 18:05.480
which is not lethal but will make you itchy.

18:05.930 --> 18:07.170
Itchy.

18:09.890 --> 18:11.480
Given that you're not going on a battlefield,

18:11.500 --> 18:12.990
you don't need to

18:13.010 --> 18:14.320
carry these big articles.

18:14.340 --> 18:15.680
These are already enough.

18:15.860 --> 18:17.230
By the way,

18:17.250 --> 18:18.930
Mr. Fei has also said that

18:18.930 --> 18:19.890
you've learned the essence of applying poison,

18:19.890 --> 18:20.960
so we didn't prepare any poison for you.

18:20.980 --> 18:22.990
Senior Fellow Apprentice, I don't have the ingredients.

18:23.010 --> 18:24.360
Tell me what you need.

18:24.380 --> 18:26.100
Maokouzi, arsenic stones

18:26.100 --> 18:27.720
nux vomica, and Nanhai camphor tree.

18:27.740 --> 18:28.870
Wait a second!

18:28.890 --> 18:31.030
Maokouzi is too bitter.

18:31.050 --> 18:32.150
It's not a good choice.

18:32.170 --> 18:33.650
Arsenic stones and nux vomica

18:33.650 --> 18:34.870
should not be hard to find.

18:34.890 --> 18:36.510
It's not convenient to buy these given my identity.

18:36.530 --> 18:38.010
It can catch others' attention too easily.

18:38.700 --> 18:39.290
OK! OK! OK!

18:39.290 --> 18:41.150
That's not a problem. The Third Division has got plenty.

18:41.170 --> 18:42.380
You probably need to bring

18:42.380 --> 18:43.630
some chloroform as well.

18:43.650 --> 18:45.050
New poison?

18:45.100 --> 18:46.720
Newly developed knockout drops.

18:46.740 --> 18:47.820
Mr. Fei has tested it before.

18:47.820 --> 18:49.110
He said it works better than nux vomica.

18:49.130 --> 18:50.200
Is it easy to detoxicate?

18:50.220 --> 18:51.910
As easy as it is for Youyexiang.

18:51.930 --> 18:53.410
So that explains it.

18:53.860 --> 18:54.980
Can we replace the arrow poison

18:54.980 --> 18:55.820
with arsenic stones?

18:55.820 --> 18:57.560
That works much faster.

19:13.770 --> 19:15.680
Murder!

19:18.700 --> 19:20.080
Your Excellency, please get off the carriage!

19:22.170 --> 19:22.580
What happened?

19:22.580 --> 19:24.030
There are enemies ahead trying to attack us.

19:24.050 --> 19:24.700
Who are they?

19:24.700 --> 19:25.380
I didn't see clearly.

19:25.380 --> 19:26.320
We've lost touch

19:26.340 --> 19:27.460
with most of the people protecting Your Excellency.

19:27.460 --> 19:28.960
They are very terrific people.

19:28.980 --> 19:30.740
How about Your Excellency leaving first?

19:30.740 --> 19:31.560
I'll defend at the back.

19:31.580 --> 19:32.840
Your Excellency. Leave first.

19:40.620 --> 19:42.080
Everyone from the Third Division comes here.

19:43.650 --> 19:44.680
People protecting Your Excellency are completely annihilated.

19:44.700 --> 19:45.960
Your Excellency. Go now!

19:58.010 --> 19:58.560
Mr. Fei!

19:58.560 --> 19:59.010
=Fei Jie, Director of the Third Division=
Teacher!

19:59.010 --> 20:00.090
=Fei Jie, Director of the Third Division of
the Investigator's Office=

20:03.740 --> 20:05.360
It stinks!

20:05.380 --> 20:06.440
The Third Division's crossbow.

20:06.460 --> 20:07.770
No. 3 poison. Oh no!

20:08.100 --> 20:09.320
No. 4 poison.

20:10.290 --> 20:11.720
You're back!

20:13.530 --> 20:14.700
Just now

20:14.700 --> 20:15.740
I saw a lot of sneaky people

20:15.740 --> 20:17.530
around you.

20:17.820 --> 20:19.050
It's alright now.

20:19.220 --> 20:21.480
I've knocked them down.

20:28.050 --> 20:29.890
Why do you look at me like that?

20:35.820 --> 20:37.080
They are from the Sixth Division?

20:37.100 --> 20:38.600
They protected me.

20:38.820 --> 20:40.290
The Investigator's Office has too many people.

20:40.290 --> 20:41.720
I don't know them all.

20:41.740 --> 20:42.870
They are not dead, are they?

20:42.890 --> 20:43.840
No!

20:43.860 --> 20:45.680
My poison is not lethal.

20:45.980 --> 20:47.200
Let's go!

20:49.130 --> 20:50.440
Your Excellency!

20:51.700 --> 20:53.010
Mr. Fei!

20:54.770 --> 20:55.680
Well, he...

20:55.700 --> 20:56.620
I'm serving

20:56.620 --> 20:58.080
His Excellency Fan now.

21:01.130 --> 21:02.800
Let's go together.

21:02.860 --> 21:04.770
Mr. Fei, haven't seen you for ages.

21:14.650 --> 21:15.960
Your Majesty!

21:21.740 --> 21:22.960
Are you here to argue?

21:22.980 --> 21:24.930
I dare not to.

21:25.380 --> 21:27.840
Then you're here for Fan Xian.

21:27.930 --> 21:30.110
Beiqi is our enemy after all.

21:30.130 --> 21:31.340
It doesn't have to be him

21:31.340 --> 21:33.600
for the visit.

21:37.820 --> 21:40.600
Minister Lu has left his position
for his hometown due to sickness.

21:40.740 --> 21:43.080
You can take his place

21:43.500 --> 21:44.460
as the Minister of Ministry of Revenue.

21:44.460 --> 21:46.270
I'm here not for promotion.

21:46.290 --> 21:47.960
I can give up the Assistant Minister

21:47.980 --> 21:50.320
if I can stop Fan Xian from going north.

21:50.500 --> 21:52.800
You want to breach the laws
and regulations of the imperial court?

21:52.820 --> 21:55.630
What if he gets killed?

21:55.650 --> 21:56.630
He should take up more challenges

21:56.650 --> 21:58.200
as a young man

21:58.220 --> 22:01.080
otherwise how will he take up bigger responsibilities?

22:01.100 --> 22:03.480
Then leave the bigger responsibilities.

22:11.580 --> 22:15.440
Do you know what I like about you?

22:16.130 --> 22:18.960
A lot of people don't wish him to go!

22:18.980 --> 22:21.290
You are the only one who comes to me for it.

22:21.930 --> 22:23.890
If someone else comes for it,

22:23.980 --> 22:26.600
it's a disobedience to the law.

22:26.620 --> 22:28.720
Who do Your Majesty mean?

22:30.100 --> 22:31.990
You have to take over the position

22:32.010 --> 22:33.960
of Minister of the Ministry of Revenue.

22:34.980 --> 22:38.410
So does Fan Xian with his visit.

22:39.410 --> 22:40.270
Your Majesty!

22:40.290 --> 22:41.890
No bargaining!

22:45.620 --> 22:47.840
Then please allow my personal guards

22:47.890 --> 22:50.200
to protect him on the way north.

22:50.770 --> 22:52.370
Don't do this again!

22:55.530 --> 23:00.130
You want me to help you stand up?

23:01.890 --> 23:03.530
Leave!

23:21.960 --> 23:23.460
=Rouge Shop=

23:23.460 --> 23:24.290
No problem!
=Rouge Shop=

23:24.290 --> 23:24.840
Help me out! Which one looks better?
=Rouge Shop=

23:24.840 --> 23:26.170
Help me out! Which one looks better?

23:26.410 --> 23:27.320
Does this one look good?

23:27.340 --> 23:28.390
Let me see!

23:28.410 --> 23:30.200
Let me do it for you!

23:30.220 --> 23:30.770
Let's exchange.

23:30.770 --> 23:31.840
How about that one?

23:31.860 --> 23:32.860
Much better now!

23:32.860 --> 23:33.890
That one is really nice.

23:33.890 --> 23:36.080
-What about this one? -This?

23:36.930 --> 23:39.930
No problem. Most people like it.

23:43.340 --> 23:45.680
That's not the look that I want.

23:45.700 --> 23:47.440
This one doesn't look good!

23:47.460 --> 23:49.050
I think it's pretty.

23:49.050 --> 23:51.290
How do you guys get in?

23:53.980 --> 23:55.960
My grandson is getting married.

23:55.980 --> 23:59.030
We want to prepare some rouge for the bride.

23:59.050 --> 24:00.720
He's shy.

24:00.740 --> 24:02.050
Get out of the way!

24:02.220 --> 24:03.870
Let the boss help us with it.

24:03.890 --> 24:05.680
Handsome boy! Handsome boy!

24:05.700 --> 24:08.230
You're really gorgeous!

24:08.250 --> 24:10.960
We all like you.

24:11.170 --> 24:12.340
His daughter doesn't deserve you.

24:12.340 --> 24:14.230
My daughter does!

24:14.250 --> 24:15.700
Don't go!

24:15.700 --> 24:17.600
She is an absolute beauty!

24:17.770 --> 24:19.080
What a pity!

24:19.100 --> 24:20.250
He didn't even talk to us.

24:20.250 --> 24:22.080
Let's go! Let's go!

24:22.410 --> 24:23.440
I'm so envious.

24:23.460 --> 24:24.720
Take your seat!

24:24.860 --> 24:26.840
Just like what it was in Danzhou.

24:42.380 --> 24:44.440
I'll be fine to stand.

24:52.930 --> 24:54.680
Who runs the shop?

24:54.700 --> 24:56.320
Me!

24:56.930 --> 24:59.130
You run a rouge shop?

25:00.290 --> 25:02.650
I went to apply poison in Beiqi the other year.

25:02.930 --> 25:04.800
My target was a woman.

25:05.250 --> 25:06.930
I had the idea

25:08.130 --> 25:10.770
to make some poisonous rouge.

25:11.770 --> 25:12.740
But that was awfully made.

25:12.740 --> 25:13.620
She didn't like it

25:13.620 --> 25:16.080
and refuse to use it.

25:17.650 --> 25:19.960
That was an accident

25:21.050 --> 25:23.960
which almost caused big trouble.

25:26.170 --> 25:28.370
Then you opened up this shop?

25:29.220 --> 25:31.170
Your Excellency may not know that

25:31.530 --> 25:32.960
these women

25:32.980 --> 25:34.960
might be very picky

25:34.980 --> 25:36.630
with the choice of rouge.

25:36.650 --> 25:38.230
But when it comes to the payment,

25:38.250 --> 25:39.630
they are really generous

25:39.650 --> 25:40.840
and ostentatious.

25:40.860 --> 25:43.440
My wife is just like that.

25:44.130 --> 25:46.630
Mr. Fei is really wise

25:46.650 --> 25:48.720
to run such a lucrative shop.

25:48.740 --> 25:50.840
It has nothing to do with money.

25:51.620 --> 25:54.370
Then why do you run this shop?

25:54.980 --> 25:56.480
Ever since then,

25:56.820 --> 25:59.050
I always have that incident in mind.

25:59.980 --> 26:02.370
If it ever happens again,

26:02.770 --> 26:05.480
there can't be any mistakes.

26:07.500 --> 26:09.290
So the shop sustains.

26:09.700 --> 26:10.410
For many years?

26:10.410 --> 26:11.770
For a lot of years.

26:12.010 --> 26:13.750
How serious was that incident

26:13.770 --> 26:15.290
that you still remember it now?

26:16.650 --> 26:18.680
That incident

26:19.380 --> 26:22.130
took the legs of Chen Pingping.

26:29.290 --> 26:31.080
Everyone poisoned?

26:31.100 --> 26:31.860
Yes!

26:31.860 --> 26:32.630
After I woke up,

26:32.650 --> 26:34.480
Director-General Fan was already gone.

26:34.500 --> 26:36.200
I've sent my people to search for him.

26:36.290 --> 26:37.230
Head,

26:37.250 --> 26:39.230
should we send people from the First Division as well?

26:39.250 --> 26:40.800
The guy who kidnapped Director-General Fan

26:40.820 --> 26:41.870
is super vicious.

26:41.890 --> 26:43.680
We'd better search for him through the whole city.

26:44.700 --> 26:47.080
Did anyone see his face?

26:47.290 --> 26:48.650
Yes!

26:51.980 --> 26:53.600
Tell me about it.

26:54.460 --> 26:55.750
Xiao En was the King of Spy

26:55.770 --> 26:57.650
in Beiqi at the time.

26:58.050 --> 26:59.530
He's constantly moving from place to place.

27:00.580 --> 27:02.440
It took a lot of manpower

27:03.860 --> 27:05.750
to get the intelligence that his son would get married.

27:05.770 --> 27:08.220
Chen Pingping led an army and travelled a thousand miles

27:08.220 --> 27:10.200
to capture him alive.

27:10.220 --> 27:11.840
I've heard about that.

27:13.380 --> 27:15.750
I arrived first that time.

27:15.770 --> 27:18.560
Xiao En and his son were pretty vigilant.

27:19.170 --> 27:21.560
I planned to poison his daughter-in-law

27:21.580 --> 27:23.930
so that I can threaten him and his son.

27:24.650 --> 27:27.200
But the rouge went wrong.

27:28.170 --> 27:29.630
The Investigator's Office

27:29.650 --> 27:32.010
lost half of its manpower in that battle.

27:33.620 --> 27:36.680
His son and daughter-in-law died on site.

27:37.100 --> 27:39.320
Chen Pingping lost his legs.

27:43.170 --> 27:44.560
I always think

27:44.580 --> 27:47.560
if I didn't make the mistake.

27:47.580 --> 27:48.890
Will the situation be any different

27:48.890 --> 27:51.200
from what it is now?

27:58.010 --> 27:59.650
It will be the same.

28:00.460 --> 28:01.960
How could people like Xiao En

28:01.980 --> 28:03.870
surrender himself

28:03.890 --> 28:05.440
just because his daughter-in-law got poisoned?

28:05.460 --> 28:06.930
No one will know

28:06.930 --> 28:09.130
if it would be the same or not.

28:11.740 --> 28:12.700
I heard that

28:12.700 --> 28:14.560
you're going to escort Xiao En to Beiqi.

28:14.580 --> 28:15.750
Yes.

28:15.770 --> 28:16.840
To get Yan Bingyun back.

28:16.860 --> 28:18.800
Which jerk comes up with such a lousy idea?

28:19.380 --> 28:20.600
Don't go!

28:20.650 --> 28:23.600
It is His Majesty's idea.

28:29.460 --> 28:31.770
You must flee from the capital city.

28:33.410 --> 28:34.560
Get prepared.

28:34.580 --> 28:35.580
We set out tonight.

28:35.580 --> 28:36.770
Teacher!

28:38.580 --> 28:41.390
Xiao En deeply hates the Investigator's Office.

28:41.410 --> 28:43.340
We can't hold back the relationship

28:43.340 --> 28:45.170
between you and me or Chen Pingping from him.

28:46.220 --> 28:47.680
How will you cope with Xiao En

28:47.770 --> 28:49.030
after you get to Beiqi?

28:49.050 --> 28:50.390
Teacher, I can manage it.

28:50.410 --> 28:51.840
Just listen to me on this.

28:53.700 --> 28:55.250
Leave tonight.

28:55.860 --> 28:57.930
I'll sort out the route of fleeing.

28:58.980 --> 28:59.460
No!

28:59.460 --> 29:00.460
Mr. Fei, how about me?

29:00.460 --> 29:01.720
Wait for us.

29:01.930 --> 29:03.360
Flee with us together at dusk.

29:03.380 --> 29:03.890
No,

29:03.890 --> 29:05.250
my wife and daughter

29:05.250 --> 29:07.010
are all in the capital city.

29:08.930 --> 29:10.560
What does that have to do with me?

29:10.580 --> 29:11.390
Teacher,

29:11.410 --> 29:12.460
neither the Investigator's Office

29:12.460 --> 29:14.010
nor the Imperial Guards will let me go!

29:17.130 --> 29:18.360
I'll kill

29:18.380 --> 29:20.370
whoever stands in our way.

29:25.650 --> 29:27.050
Including me?

29:27.620 --> 29:29.080
How do you know this place?

29:29.100 --> 29:30.770
I know it all the time.

29:36.890 --> 29:38.320
Fan Xian can't go to Beiqi.

29:38.340 --> 29:41.370
You know the consequence to act against the imperial edict.

29:42.130 --> 29:43.870
If Fan Xian flees,

29:43.890 --> 29:44.620
he will have no ground to stand in Nanqing

29:44.620 --> 29:47.530
for the rest of his life.

29:48.170 --> 29:50.230
That's not any worse than dying in Beiqi.

29:50.250 --> 29:51.480
So what?

29:51.500 --> 29:52.840
You want him to be like you

29:52.860 --> 29:53.960
who travels around the world

29:53.980 --> 29:54.700
and never be able to see

29:54.700 --> 29:56.030
families or friends?

29:56.050 --> 29:57.800
I am old.

29:58.290 --> 30:00.270
Over all the years I've spent in the Investigator's Office,

30:00.290 --> 30:00.860
I've seen enough of this type

30:00.860 --> 30:02.720
of life and death farewell.

30:02.740 --> 30:05.010
I can't watch him dying.

30:14.620 --> 30:16.080
Besides,

30:16.860 --> 30:18.480
after I die,

30:19.580 --> 30:21.650
there is gotta be someone burying me.

30:23.010 --> 30:24.530
I can't find anyone else

30:25.620 --> 30:27.650
other than Fan Xian.

30:31.860 --> 30:34.250
If only one person can live in the world,

30:34.340 --> 30:36.770
I will surely choose Fan Xian.

30:36.890 --> 30:38.390
Then why do you let him

30:38.410 --> 30:41.130
escort Xiao En to Beiqi?

30:45.820 --> 30:47.480
Do you know?

30:47.500 --> 30:49.010
After he comes back this time,

30:50.250 --> 30:51.290
the future of the capital city

30:51.290 --> 30:53.110
will all be in his hands.

30:53.130 --> 30:55.030
That's too dangerous, Head Chen.

30:55.050 --> 30:57.870
Whose life isn't dangerous?

30:57.890 --> 30:58.580
If he shall live

30:58.580 --> 30:59.500
under your shadow and mine,

30:59.500 --> 31:00.410
he'll be ruined.

31:00.410 --> 31:01.650
Don't worry!

31:01.650 --> 31:03.630
I'll ensure his safety.

31:03.650 --> 31:05.050
Stand up!

31:05.130 --> 31:07.050
I'll trust you if you stand up now.

31:07.460 --> 31:09.290
It was because of me back then

31:09.980 --> 31:12.250
that you lost your legs.

31:18.460 --> 31:19.800
Your Excellency!

31:21.820 --> 31:23.050
Teacher,

31:23.380 --> 31:25.080
I'm willing to go to Beiqi.

31:27.050 --> 31:28.750
Li Yunrui betrayed Yan Bingyun

31:28.770 --> 31:30.410
to destroy me.

31:30.530 --> 31:32.370
I'm the cause of it.

31:32.650 --> 31:34.560
So I have to get him back.

32:18.740 --> 32:20.440
So beautiful!

32:35.380 --> 32:36.800
Didn't you say

32:36.820 --> 32:38.360
you have important things to tell me?

32:38.380 --> 32:40.130
Why don't you talk?

32:42.220 --> 32:43.890
I'm going to Beiqi.

32:44.340 --> 32:45.770
I know.

32:46.770 --> 32:47.870
Actually, I don't want to go.

32:47.890 --> 32:49.250
Then don't!

32:54.220 --> 32:55.800
The worse result is to disappoint His Majesty's will

32:55.820 --> 32:57.530
and go back to Danzhou with you.

33:01.170 --> 33:03.130
If I don't go to Beiqi,

33:04.130 --> 33:07.650
the marriage contract will be gone.

33:08.220 --> 33:09.890
That's the idea of His Majesty?

33:11.170 --> 33:12.930
Who else's could it be?

33:14.100 --> 33:16.130
We can elope.

33:26.770 --> 33:28.480
I've saved up a little bit of money.

33:28.500 --> 33:30.010
If we keep ourselves frugal,

33:30.010 --> 33:31.800
it's enough for our whole lives.

33:33.100 --> 33:35.480
The only thing is the Investigator's Office may come after us.

33:36.050 --> 33:37.530
How about

33:38.290 --> 33:39.390
going out on the sea?

33:39.410 --> 33:42.010
Set out on sail with a large boat.

33:42.010 --> 33:43.510
We stop at wherever it goes

33:43.530 --> 33:44.250
until no one

33:44.250 --> 33:46.170
can find us.

33:46.460 --> 33:47.630
Setting out on sail

33:47.650 --> 33:48.990
means never being able to come back.

33:49.010 --> 33:50.250
Aren't you afraid?

33:50.290 --> 33:53.530
You will protect me, right?

34:05.340 --> 34:08.010
You're too adorable. I couldn't hold it.

34:09.940 --> 34:12.130
I'm serious.

34:14.340 --> 34:16.040
If you elope with me,

34:17.180 --> 34:18.510
do you know how many people will laugh at you?

34:18.530 --> 34:19.180
I don't care.

34:19.180 --> 34:20.490
I do!

34:22.530 --> 34:23.930
Wait for me to come back.

34:25.010 --> 34:26.840
After I come back from Beiqi,

34:27.010 --> 34:28.560
let's get married.

34:35.450 --> 34:37.400
I don't want you

34:37.420 --> 34:39.000
to force yourself

34:39.180 --> 34:40.990
into something you don't like for me.

34:41.010 --> 34:42.370
Not at all.

34:43.860 --> 34:45.710
Knowing that we can get married after I come back,

34:45.730 --> 34:47.600
I wish I could set out tonight.

34:48.580 --> 34:50.160
Aren't you afraid of being watched?

34:50.180 --> 34:51.370
No!

34:51.420 --> 34:52.970
I've sent them away.

34:53.100 --> 34:54.600
You sent them away?

34:58.340 --> 35:00.690
So you did plan it.

35:00.770 --> 35:02.130
Come on! I'm about to leave.

35:02.420 --> 35:03.860
Take it as a farewell gift.

35:03.860 --> 35:06.490
Wait! Stand straight.

35:07.690 --> 35:09.970
Put your hands at the back and don't move.

35:11.940 --> 35:13.600
We must agree on three points of law.

35:13.820 --> 35:17.130
Firstly, don't flirt with any other ladies in Beiqi.

35:17.180 --> 35:18.800
No one but you would accept me.

35:18.820 --> 35:20.600
What if there is someone?

35:21.450 --> 35:24.320
I accept no one but you.

35:36.010 --> 35:37.970
I couldn't hold it.

35:47.730 --> 35:48.900
Why do you laugh?

35:48.900 --> 35:49.990
No, I don't.

35:50.010 --> 35:52.130
I couldn't help enjoying the aftertaste.

36:00.660 --> 36:02.400
You said three points of law.

36:02.420 --> 36:03.840
So what are the rest two points?

36:05.860 --> 36:07.560
I haven't come up yet.

36:07.580 --> 36:09.950
No worries. Take your time.

36:09.970 --> 36:11.400
What are you doing?

36:11.420 --> 36:12.320
I miss you already.

36:12.340 --> 36:13.670
You haven't left yet.

36:13.690 --> 36:15.320
I start to miss you even before I leave.

36:15.530 --> 36:17.490
Fine, but hold you mouth back from me.

36:19.860 --> 36:22.040
Sure, whatever you say.

36:26.490 --> 36:28.450
Listen to me carefully.

36:29.820 --> 36:31.890
You must come back alive

36:32.730 --> 36:34.760
from this journey.

36:36.660 --> 36:38.690
I'll be waiting for you here

36:40.620 --> 36:42.560
with cherry flowers.

37:56.690 --> 37:58.080
Xie Bi'an

37:58.100 --> 37:59.010
is not only good sword

37:59.010 --> 38:00.970
but also a scary one.

38:03.340 --> 38:05.040
Let him in.

38:13.900 --> 38:15.080
You sent Wan'er back?

38:15.100 --> 38:17.160
I don't remember having such pavilion before.

38:17.180 --> 38:18.320
Just built it.

38:18.530 --> 38:19.840
Watch out!

38:20.420 --> 38:21.560
There is no base!

38:21.580 --> 38:23.170
This will be removed after the drink.

38:27.210 --> 38:28.890
This is just for a drink?

38:31.100 --> 38:32.320
You can't leave me waiting

38:32.340 --> 38:34.750
in the middle of the road, right?

38:34.770 --> 38:36.890
So I built this pavilion.

38:39.420 --> 38:41.040
Why do you look at me like that?

38:41.100 --> 38:42.750
As a prince,

38:42.770 --> 38:44.650
wouldn't it be a breach of duty

38:45.660 --> 38:47.650
if I don't live extravagantly?

38:48.690 --> 38:50.970
That makes sense.

38:54.660 --> 38:56.320
A toast to you.

39:02.660 --> 39:03.840
Good liquor.

39:05.940 --> 39:07.600
Is it?

39:09.620 --> 39:11.030
With the support of this scenery,

39:11.050 --> 39:12.730
any liquor can be good.

39:16.050 --> 39:17.450
When do you set out?

39:17.530 --> 39:18.930
In a couple of days.

39:20.770 --> 39:22.400
When you come back,

39:22.420 --> 39:24.490
you'll enjoy enviable reputation.

39:25.140 --> 39:27.560
By then, the imperial examinations
held in spring will start soon.

39:28.290 --> 39:30.130
I'll plead His Majesty

39:31.620 --> 39:33.370
to appoint you as the examiner.

39:34.660 --> 39:36.650
I don't have any reputation.

39:38.340 --> 39:40.450
The title of the Poetic Genius Fan is enough.

39:41.180 --> 39:43.690
Once you organize the imperial examinations held in spring,

39:44.010 --> 39:47.510
you'll become the examiner of those students.

39:47.530 --> 39:49.360
It's hard to fully describe

39:49.380 --> 39:51.410
the advantages behind it.

39:51.770 --> 39:53.370
Feel it yourself.

39:54.250 --> 39:55.650
I'm just curious

39:55.820 --> 39:57.370
why Your Highness give such a good chance

39:57.490 --> 39:59.600
to me.

40:07.620 --> 40:08.750
You're not hateful

40:08.770 --> 40:10.520
and can drink with me together.

40:11.210 --> 40:14.370
Even if you follow the Crown Prince in the end,

40:15.730 --> 40:17.760
we can still be friends.

40:19.820 --> 40:21.600
Your Highness is most generous.

40:32.620 --> 40:35.170
This world is full of common people.

40:35.620 --> 40:37.890
There aren't many people

40:38.580 --> 40:40.370
with whom you can open your heart.

40:40.660 --> 40:42.450
I've read your poems.

40:44.140 --> 40:47.760
"The capital city has so many officials.

40:48.250 --> 40:52.130
Only this one guy looks frustrated and unhappy."

40:52.180 --> 40:54.210
There are certain sincerity behind it.

41:02.420 --> 41:04.730
There are a lot of routes to the north.

41:05.450 --> 41:08.510
The guardian at Fengming Pass is my follower.

41:08.530 --> 41:10.730
If you go through there, I'll ask him to protect you.

41:11.050 --> 41:12.320
Thank you,

41:12.340 --> 41:13.450
but we probably won't go through Fengming

41:13.450 --> 41:15.120
this time.

41:15.140 --> 41:16.800
Because it's a long route.

41:17.530 --> 41:18.640
Then forget about it.

41:18.660 --> 41:21.650
The feast is over and now it's time to move apart.

41:21.940 --> 41:23.750
It is a pretty good day.

41:23.770 --> 41:25.970
I'll wait for your return.

41:28.010 --> 41:29.370
See you!

42:12.380 --> 42:14.160
Don't tell anyone

42:14.180 --> 42:15.920
about which pass you'll go through

42:15.940 --> 42:17.320
for today's journey.

42:17.690 --> 42:19.410
Keep the decision to yourself only.

42:19.450 --> 42:20.760
I understand.

42:22.770 --> 42:25.170
Your poison technique is better than ever.

42:27.050 --> 42:28.490
This is newly made.

42:29.420 --> 42:31.160
Smash it at critical moment.

42:31.180 --> 42:32.880
It won't take any lives

42:32.900 --> 42:35.000
or hurt anyone physically,

42:35.100 --> 42:36.770
but even Great Masters

42:36.770 --> 42:38.450
will sleep quite a while from it.

42:38.820 --> 42:39.640
Thank you, Teacher!

42:39.660 --> 42:40.840
No problem.

42:41.340 --> 42:43.000
Just don't show off with it.

43:07.960 --> 43:11.540
In the river of history,

43:11.560 --> 43:15.030
time goes round and round.

43:17.840 --> 43:21.180
Memories about the former and present lives

43:21.200 --> 43:25.270
join each other in an endless way.

43:27.160 --> 43:29.780
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:29.800 --> 43:32.040
one season follows another in a flash,

43:32.040 --> 43:34.540
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:34.560 --> 43:36.160
I just can't give up

43:36.160 --> 43:39.500
to be with you for my whole life.

43:39.520 --> 43:44.990
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:46.240 --> 43:48.790
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:49.080 --> 43:51.120
Year after year in the wandering,

43:51.120 --> 43:53.780
I count the remaining years.

43:53.800 --> 43:55.980
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:56.000 --> 43:57.990
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:58.280 --> 44:00.670
I never feel regretful.

44:00.720 --> 44:02.080
In such a chaotic world,

44:02.080 --> 44:05.060
I still miss you as ever.

44:05.080 --> 44:08.030
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:08.320 --> 44:10.380
With a gentle heart,

44:10.400 --> 44:13.060
I cherish our remaining years.

44:13.080 --> 44:14.600
Even though we have to go through

44:14.600 --> 44:17.110
all the hardships along the journey,

44:17.240 --> 44:24.430
you always stay by my side,

44:24.520 --> 44:27.190
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:27.480 --> 44:29.560
Year after year in the wandering,

44:29.560 --> 44:32.220
I count the remaining years.

44:32.240 --> 44:34.380
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:34.400 --> 44:36.630
even though we end up the destiny,

44:36.840 --> 44:39.020
I never feel regretful.

44:39.040 --> 44:40.440
In such a chaotic world,

44:40.440 --> 44:43.500
I still miss you as ever.

44:43.520 --> 44:46.630
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:46.720 --> 44:48.860
With a gentle heart,

44:48.880 --> 44:51.580
I cherish our remaining years.

44:51.600 --> 44:53.040
Even though we have to go through

44:53.040 --> 44:55.700
all the hardships along the journey,

44:55.720 --> 45:04.480
you always stay by my side...
